# Agentforge — Cline Rules

> The single source of truth for coding, lint, import and type-contract rules is **AGENTS.md**. Read it first.
> See **CLAUDE.md** for project structure and environment setup.

---

## Project summary

A ComfyUI-style agent architecture builder. Design and run LLM agent pipelines visually on a node canvas.

- **Backend**: FastAPI + LangGraph (Python 3.12, `server/`)
- **Frontend**: React + TypeScript + Vite (`ui/`)
- **WebSocket integration**: `ws://localhost:8000/ws/run`

```
Frontend canvas (React Flow)
    │ WebSocket
    ▼
Backend WS handler (main.py)
    │ dispatch_graph(arch_name)
    ▼
LangGraph StateGraph (graphs/*.py)
    │ emit(make_event(...))
    ▼
Frontend node state update
```

---

